     "<div dir=\"auto\">Hi there,<div><br></div><div>thanks a lot to everyone for your work on this. When will the fix be available through normal cran update? I’m using GRM in my PhD thesis, so I would like to recalculate those data. I’m not in a hurry for once, so take your time, but I would be glad to have an ETA about the corresponding update of the package.</div><div><br></div><div>Regards, Martin <div dir=\"ltr\"><br><blockquote type=\"cite\">Am 05.07.2023 um 10:44 schrieb <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">mirt-p...@googlegroups.com</a>:<br><br></blockquote></div><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div dir=\"ltr\">﻿\r\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #d3d3d3;max-width:850px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000\">\r\n  <div style=\"background-color:#f5f5f5;padding:10px 20px\">\r\n    <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%\">\r\n      <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n          <td style=\"width:70%\">\r\n            <span style=\"font:18px/20px arial;color:#333333\">\r\n              <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email#!forum/mirt-package/topics\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:#333333\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail%23!forum/mirt-package/topics&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792470807673000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2RDE65yzO_wUKJU5tmsjp9\">\r\n              mirt-p...@googlegroups.com</a>\r\n            </span>\r\n          </td>\r\n          <td style=\"text-align:right;width:30%\">\r\n            <span style=\"font:20px/24px arial\"><a style=\"color:#dd4b39;text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email/#!overview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail/%23!overview&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792470807673000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3nwIrQ3yEsmKAenr2QuWqh\">Google Groups</a></span>\r\n          </td>\r\n          <td style=\"width:32px\">\r\n            <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email/#!overview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail/%23!overview&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792470807673000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3nwIrQ3yEsmKAenr2QuWqh\"><img style=\"border:0;vertical-align:middle\" src=\"https://ci5.googleusercontent.com/proxy/4SGWHe9midrWMDxDIJMQraTMMgnAU71soPZ0D28IOSZcs66TdyRoCqyIhaTt-kwo0YKv2lRo05RkwsGFZdnFhdvy60XdxNlL2U-B=s0-d-e1-ft#http://www.google.com/images/icons/product/groups-32.png\"></a>\r\n          </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n      </tbody>\r\n    </table>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div style=\"padding:20px;background-color:#f5f5f5\">\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:arial;color:#222222;padding:0px\">\r\n  <a name=\"m_3700376136736757169_digest_top\" style=\"font-size:21px\" rel=\"nofollow\">\r\n  \r\n  \r\n    Topic digest\r\n  \r\n  </a><br>\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:11px\">\r\n    <a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email#!forum/mirt-package/topics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail%23!forum/mirt-package/topics&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792470807673000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2RDE65yzO_wUKJU5tmsjp9\">View all topics</a>\r\n  </span>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font:13px/18px arial;color:#222222;padding:0px;margin-bottom:30px\">\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-left:3px;padding-left:0px\">\r\n  \r\n    <li>\r\n      <a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_3700376136736757169_group_thread_0\" rel=\"nofollow\">\r\n      Surprisingly poor M2 fit for a 7-factor graded response model raises concerns about incorporation of factor covariances</a> -\r\n      <span style=\"color:#777777\">2 Updates</span>\r\n    </li>\r\n  \r\n  </ul>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n  <a name=\"m_3700376136736757169_group_thread_0\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>\r\n  <div style=\"display:inline-block;font-family:arial;padding:4px 0 5px 0px\">\r\n  \r\n    <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/mirt-package/t/75c19a74f4ed4df2?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email\" style=\"font-size:21px;color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/mirt-package/t/75c19a74f4ed4df2?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792470807673000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2Aq8OG8BHxXFWgeJB7GxzZ\">\r\n      Surprisingly poor M2 fit for a 7-factor graded response model raises concerns about incorporation of factor covariances\r\n    </a>\r\n  \r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\r\n    \r\n      <tbody><tr><td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;color:#2e2e2e;font-family:arial;padding:10px 15px;border:1px solid #d3d3d3\">\r\n        <span style=\"color:#b1b0b0;font-size:15px\">\r\n          G Kephart &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">george....@dal.ca</a>&gt;: Jul 04 09:53AM -0700\r\n        </span>\r\n        <br><br>\r\n        I had posted this issue on GitHub as well, and the problem was  due to a <br>\r\nbug in the software when using the QMC=TRUE option, and  is now fixed. <br>\r\n From Phil Chalmers:<br>\r\n <br>\r\n*&quot;**Thanks very much for the report. This was indeed an implementation bug <br>\r\nwhen using QMC integration post-convergence. For whatever reason I forgot <br>\r\nto include the latent mean/variable shift in the integration grid after the <br>\r\nmodels were fitted, and M2() was one such area where this makes a large <br>\r\ndifference. I&#39;ve added this into the package now to fix the problem, which <br>\r\nalso appeared in fscores() and residuals(). Quite frustrating, but I&#39;m glad <br>\r\nthis was detected.&quot; *<br>\r\n <br>\r\nMore detail on the problem and fix can be found in the now closed issue on <br>\r\nthe mirt Github respository: <br>\r\n<a href=\"https://github.com/philchalmers/mirt/issues/240\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/philchalmers/mirt/issues/240&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792470807673000&amp;usg=AOvVaw078fKEMJepZ7bHBAfCI178\">https://github.com/philchalmers/mirt/issues/240</a><br>\r\n <br>\r\n <br>\r\nOn Thursday, 29 June 2023 at 16:12:41 UTC-3 G Kephart wrote:<br>\r\n <br>\r\n\r\n      </td></tr>\r\n    \r\n      <tr><td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;color:#2e2e2e;font-family:arial;padding:10px 15px;border:1px solid #d3d3d3\">\r\n        <span style=\"color:#b1b0b0;font-size:15px\">\r\n          &quot;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">zha...@gmail.com</a>&quot; &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">zhao...@gmail.com</a>&gt;: Jul 04 08:39PM -0700\r\n        </span>\r\n        <br><br>\r\n        Thanks for this information. I am wondering if this affect the M2 fit <br>\r\nstatistics for EFA models? Thanks. I am using mirt 1.37.1<br>\r\n <br>\r\n\r\n      </td></tr>\r\n    \r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  <div style=\"font-size:11px;margin-bottom:40px;margin-top:5px\">\r\n    <a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_3700376136736757169_digest_top\" rel=\"nofollow\">Back to top</a>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div style=\"background-color:#f5f5f5;padding:5px 20px\">\r\n  <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%\">\r\n  <tbody><tr>\r\n    <td style=\"padding-top:4px;font-family:arial,sans-serif;color:#636363;font-size:11px\">\r\n      \r\n      You received this digest because you&#39;re subscribed to updates for this group. You can change your settings on the <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email#!forum/mirt-package/join\" style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail%23!forum/mirt-package/join&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792470807673000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3cPP7TmM24_KnkuCqu4dTE\">group membership page</a>.<br>\r\n      To unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">mirt-package...@googlegroups.com</a>.\r\n    </td>\r\n  </tr></tbody>\r\n  </table>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</div></blockquote></div></div>"
